# GEOG 5 Lecture Review Site

When the user watches or asks about **GEOG 5 (Fritschle)** Canvas module lectures / Studio videos:

1. Prefer extracting the **Studio English transcript** (`Download Transcript`) when available.
2. Update the living review site (do **not** create a separate one-off page per video):
   - Canonical: `docs/geog5-study/index.html`
   - Mirror: `/Users/kainozawa/Desktop/GEOG5-Study/index.html`
3. Also keep companion markdown in the same folders:
   - Lecture sheet (condensed notes)
   - Full script (cleaned transcript)
4. In `index.html`, add or fill the entry inside the `MODULES` array (`status: "ready"`, sheet / cards / quiz / checklist).
5. Keep Module 1 Video 2 placeholder id `m1-grid` until that lecture is added; then replace `planned` content.
6. Open the updated `index.html` in the browser after changes when the user is studying.
